{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28437","headline":"怀锺陵旧游四首 二 · 杜牧","name":"怀锺陵旧游四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"滕阁中春绮席开，柘枝蛮鼓殷晴雷。\n垂楼万幕青云合，破浪千帆阵马来。\n未掘双龙牛斗气，高悬一榻栋梁材。\n连巴控越知何事，珠翠沈檀处处堆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28437.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28437","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}